concept:australian-heritage-council-consequential-and-transitional-provisions-act-2003-sch-1-sec-31 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "31 Evidence on heritage values of a place"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-31 ;
    values:originalText "If a matter relating to heritage values of a place (within the meaning of the Environment Protection and Biodiversity Conservation Act 1999) is relevant to an inquiry:  (a) the Secretary of the Department that administers that Act; or  (b) an employee in that Department authorised in writing by the Secretary for the purposes of this section; must give evidence about the matter to the inquiry. Telecommunications Act 1997" ;
    skos:definition "If a matter relating to heritage values of a place (within the meaning of the Environment Protection and Biodiversity Conservation Act 1999) is relevant to an inquiry:  (a) the Secretary of the Department that administers that Act; or  (b) an employee in that Department authorised in writing by the Secretary for the purposes of this section; must give evidence about the matter to the inquiry. Telecommunications Act 1997"@en ;
