    skos:definition "Repeal the subparagraphs, substitute:  (i) included in the National Heritage List or Commonwealth Heritage List, within the meaning of the Environment Protection and Biodiversity Conservation Act 1999; or  (ii) included in the Register of the National Estate, within the meaning of the Australian Heritage Council Act 2003; or"@en ;
