concept:australian-heritage-council-consequential-and-transitional-provisions-act-2003-sch-2-sec-8 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "8 Australian Heritage Council (Consequential and Transitional Provisions) Act 2003"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-8 ;
    values:originalText "No. 86, 2003 (4) In this item: assets official means the person or authority who, under a law of the Commonwealth, a State or a Territory, under a trust instrument or otherwise, has responsibility for keeping a register in relation to assets of the kind concerned." ;
